abraflexi-clientzone (2.9.2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * The dashboard showed "1st reminder" and "2nd reminder" with today's date
    on an invoice that has no reminders: AbraFlexi delivers an empty date as an
    object with today's date and the flag isNull, which Customer::dateToIso()
    took for a real date. An empty date is empty now; the reminders are shown
    only after abraflexi-reminder fills them.

